	["The {item:10030}"] = "{item:10030}",
	-- {item:12185} Bloodsail Admiral's Hat · {area:35} Booty Bay · {zone:1418} Badlands
	["Back to Firallon for the {item:12185} (in Classic its use calls a parrot to your shoulder): 200 more Bloodsail and 1,000 less {area:35}. Bruisers pay 25 only up to the end of Honored and Jazzrik, a lone goblin in the {zone:1418}, 5 up to the end of Revered; no quest is left, so Exalted cannot be reached."] = "回去找舰队指挥官菲尔拉伦领取{item:12185}（经典版中使用后会在肩上召唤一只鹦鹉）：再获得200血帆声望，并损失1,000点{area:35}声望。卫兵每个奖励25，但最多只能到尊敬末尾；{zone:1418}独居的地精加兹里克每次奖励5，最多到崇敬末尾；此后已无任务可做，因此无法达到崇拜。",

	-- Step 8: The way back
	["The way back"] = "恢复声望的办法",
	-- {area:392} Ratchet · {area:35} Booty Bay · {area:976} Gadgetzan · {area:2255} Everlook · {npc:14637} Zorbin Fandazzle · {zone:1444} Feralas
	["Every goblin town is now Hated. Forever's quest data takes the town reputation off the four goblin amends quests outside {area:392}, {area:35}, {area:976} and {area:2255}, so the climb back is the Cartel's own: {npc:14637} in {zone:1444} serves everyone, and his Zapped Giants quests pay 25 to every town at once; Bloodsail pirates give {area:35} 5 each up to the end of Neutral (and cost Bloodsail 25); Southsea pirates and the Venture Co. in Stranglethorn give the towns 5 each. The Steamwheedle Cartel guide has the details. Expect it to take longer than the war did."] = "现在所有地精城镇对你都是仇恨。无限服的任务数据移除了{area:392}、{area:35}、{area:976}和{area:2255}外四个地精赎罪任务的城镇声望奖励，因此恢复声望得走热砂港自己的途径：{zone:1444}的{npc:14637}为所有人提供任务，他的“被缩小的巨人”任务每次同时为所有城镇增加25声望；血帆海盗每个增加5点{area:35}声望，最多到中立末尾（同时扣除25血帆声望）；南海海盗和荆棘谷的风险投资公司成员每个增加5点城镇声望。详见热砂港声望指南。预计恢复声望要比先前开战花更久。",
	-- {npc:14637} Zorbin Fandazzle
